[ti:晚霞 片尾主題曲]
[by:英文歌詞照成品聽寫，時間由辨識對齊後校正]

[00:13.60]Tucked away inside a tiny bar
[00:19.00]Seven wooden stools against the dark
[00:26.50]Rain was falling in the narrow street
[00:32.00]Whispered through the glass so soft and sweet
[00:39.50]I pour it slow, there is saffron in my glass
[00:47.80]The sunset glows, memories that cannot pass
[00:55.40]Hibiscus red is at the base
[00:59.40]Recalling every line of your face
[01:05.30]She wrote everything by her own hand
[01:11.20]Flavors that her tongue could not command
[01:17.30]Take a little sip, is it sweet?
[01:24.40]Asking me each time we would meet
[01:30.80]I pour it slow, there is saffron in my glass
[01:38.90]The sunset glows, memories that cannot pass
[01:46.40]A layer of pink right on top
[01:51.00]Hoping that this moment won't stop
[01:57.20]She told me always remember to eat
[02:03.40]So I keep living on my own two feet
[02:09.60]Stings for a moment when it hits my tongue
[02:15.90]But then it is sweet, just like when we were young
[02:22.60]It is still sweet, I whisper to you
[02:27.80]As dusk paints the room in a dark shade of blue
[02:34.20]The bar is still open, the light is still on
[02:38.70]I'm tender and grateful, though you are now gone
